        "## 1.5 Diagnosis\n",
        "\n",
        "To detect multicollinearity:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. **Correlation Matrix**: Pairwise correlations exceeding |0.80| signal potential collinearity between two variables.\n",
        "2. **Variance Inflation Factor (VIF)**: Calculate VIF for each predictor. VIF > 5 is moderate; VIF > 10 is severe. As shown above, several stocks exhibit VIF values above the warning threshold.\n",
