        "\n",
        "To detect overfitting:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. **Train/Test Split**: A large gap between in-sample MSE and out-of-sample MSE is the clearest signal. As shown above, degree-12 polynomial has near-zero training error but exploding test error.\n",
